    realityCheck: 'Inkqubo ye-ARV yenye yeempumelelo zokwenene zempilo yoluntu eMzantsi Afrika. Imbonelelo yamayeza izinzile — ukuphelelwa ngamayeza kwilizwe lonke, obekade buyingxaki enkulu, kunqabile ukususela ku-2020 ngenxa yokuthengwa okuphakathi ngeSebe leZempilo leSizwe. Apho inkqubo isokola khona kukugcinwa kwezigulane: malunga ne-20% yezigulane iyaphuma kunyango kunyaka wokuqala, ngokufuthi ngenxa yehlazo, iindleko zothutho (R50-R100 kuhambo ngalunye lokuya ekliniki kwiindawo zasemaphandleni), okanye amaxesha amade okulinda. I-CCMDD kunye neeklabhu zokuthobela unyango zincedile, kodwa ukugutyungelwa akulingani — i-Gauteng ne-Western Cape zineendawo zokulanda ezininzi kakhulu kune-Limpopo okanye i-Eastern Cape. Ukuba ikliniki yakho iphelelwa ngamayeza rhoqo okanye inamaxesha okulinda angaphezu kweeyure ezi-4, unelungelo lokutshintshela ifayile yakho kuyo nayiphi na enye ikliniki karhulumente — cela umphathi weziko incwadi yokutshintsha.',
