    eligibility: 'Nabani na onezimpawu (ukukhohlela iiveki ezingaphezu kwezi-2, ukwehla kobunzima, ukubila ebusuku, ifiva) kufuneka ahlolwe. Unyango lusimahla kuwo wonke umntu — abemi, abemi bamanye amazwe, nabantu abangenamaxwebhu. I-TB sisifo ekufuneka sixeliwe kwaye ukusinyanga kukhusela uluntu lonke. Iinkampani zemigodi zinyanzelekile ngokomthetho ukuba zihlole abasebenzi minyaka le zize zibanike unyango, kodwa abasebenzi bemigodi abangekho semthethweni badla ngokuwela ezikhewini.',
