    realityCheck: 'I-TB isengowona nobangela unye ophambili wokusweleka kwabantu eMzantsi Afrika, ikakhulu ngenxa yokufunyaniswa kade kwesifo nokuphazamiseka konyango — kungekhona ngenxa yokuba unyango lungasebenzi. Ikhambi leenyanga ezi-6 liphilisa ngaphezu kwe-85% yeemeko ezisabelayo kumayeza xa ligqitywa. Umngeni wokwenene kukuba malunga nesigulane esi-1 kwezi-3 asilugqibi unyango lonke: baziva bengcono emva kweenyanga ezi-2-3 baze bayeke, okanye basokola ngotyelelo lwekliniki lwemihla ngemihla lwe-DOTS. Amaziko ahluke kakhulu kwindlela alawula ngayo i-TB — amanye anamagumbi e-TB azinikeleyo anoxinzelelo lomoya oluphantsi, ngelixa amanye ehlola izigulane kumagumbi okulinda aqhelekileyo, nto leyo enomngcipheko wokusasazeka kwesifo. Ukuba ikliniki yakho ayibahluli abantu abane-TB kumgca oqhelekileyo, yiphakamise loo nto kumphathi weziko. Umgangatho ophezulu ligumbi lokubonana elizinikele le-TB elinomoya wemvelo ohamba ngokutsholozayo.',
