    myths: [
      { myth: 'Ukuba iqabane lam libonakala liphile kakuhle, alinakuba ne-HIV.', fact: 'Umntu ophila ne-HIV unokubonakala ephile kakuhle ngokupheleleyo iminyaka esi-8-10 engenanyango — akukho mpawu zibonakalayo kwixesha elingapheliyo. Ekuphela kwendlela yokwazi kukuvavanywa. EMzantsi Afrika, 1 kubantu abadala aba-5 abaneminyaka eli-15-49 une-HIV. Abaninzi abasazi isimo sabo. Ukubonakala akukuxeleli nto ngesimo se-HIV.' },
      { myth: 'Unokufumana i-HIV ngokwabelana ngokutya, ngokwangana, okanye ngokusebenzisa indlu yangasese enye.', fact: 'I-HIV ithathelwana kuphela ngamanzi omzimba athile: igazi, ubudoda, amanzi esibeleko, amanzi empundu, nobisi lwebele. Ayinakuphila ngaphandle komzimba ngaphezu kwemizuzu embalwa. Awunakufumana i-HIV ngokwabelana ngokutya, ngokubulisana ngesandla, ngokwangana, ngokuncamisana, ngokwabelana ngendlu yangasese, ngamachibi okuqubha, okanye ngokulunywa yingcongconi. Ezi ntsomi zibangela ucalucalulo kwaye zithintela abantu ekuvavanyweni nasekufuneni unyango.' },
      { myth: 'I-HIV sisigwebo sokufa.', fact: 'Ngonyango lwanamhlanje (TLD — ipilisi enye ngosuku), umntu ofunyaniswe ene-HIV namhlanje unethuba lokuphila ubomi obude phantse buqhelekile. Inkqubo ye-ARV yaseMzantsi Afrika yeyona inkulu ehlabathini, inabantu abangaphezu kwe-5.7 million abasenyangweni. Amanani okucinezelwa kwentsholongwane angaphezu kwe-90% kwizigulane ezihlala zisenyangweni. Umntu one-HIV onentsholongwane engabonakaliyo akanakuyidlulisela intsholongwane kumaqabane esondo — oku kwaziwa njenge-U=U (Undetectable = Untransmittable) kwaye kuxhaswa luvavanyo lweeklinikhi oluninzi.' },
    ],
    provincialNotes: '<strong>KwaZulu-Natal</strong> inelona nani liphezulu labantu abane-HIV (i-27% yabantu abadala abaneminyaka eli-15-49) kwaye yenza uvavanyo oluninzi — izithili zaseuMgungundlovu naseeThekwini zodwa zivavanya abantu abangaphezu kwe-2 million minyaka le. Uvavanyo olusekuhlaleni kwiindawo zeeteksi, ezicaweni, nakwimisitho yemveli luye lwasebenza kakhulu apha. <strong>Gauteng</strong> inothungelwano olukhulu lweendawo zovavanyo ezimiyo (amaziko angaphezu kwama-500) kunye neeyunithi zovavanyo ezihambayo ezisebenza eJohannesburg CBD, eTshwane, naseEkurhuleni. Ukusetyenziswa kwe-PrEP kuphezulu kakhulu eGauteng, kuqhutywa ziikliniki ezixhaswa ngama-NGO eHillbrow naseSandton. <strong>Western Cape</strong> ifikelela kwelona nani liphezulu lokudibaniswa nonyango (i-88% yabantu abafunyaniswa bene-HIV baqala i-ARV phakathi kweentsuku ezi-7), ikakhulu ngeendlela ezisebenzayo zokuqalisa ngayo loo mini kumaziko ezempilo asekuhlaleni. Ukusasazwa kwezixhobo zokuzivavanya kusebenza kakhulu eWestern Cape ngeDesmond Tutu HIV Foundation. <strong>Mpumalanga</strong> inelona nani liphezulu lesibini (i-24%) emva kweKZN kwaye iqhuba amaphulo amakhulu e-VMMC — amadoda angaphezu kwama-400,000 alusiwe ukususela ngo-2012. Ukuvavanywa kwamadoda aselula (eli-15-24) kusesona sikhewu sikhulu. <strong>Eastern Cape</strong> inamanani asezantsi (i-19%) kodwa iziseko zezempilo ezibuthathaka — uvavanyo kwiindawo zasemaphandleni zaseOR Tambo naseAlfred Nzo luxhomekeke kakhulu kwiiyunithi ezihambayo zama-NGO afana ne-Right to Care. <strong>Limpopo</strong> inelona nani lisezantsi ephondweni (i-14%) kodwa inamaqela anamanani aphezulu kakhulu kwizithili zaseMopani naseVhembe, agxile kubantu abafuduka bevela eZimbabwe naseMozambiki. <strong>Free State</strong> ineenkqubo ezomeleleyo zovavanyo kwicandelo lemigodi (imigodi ivavanya abasebenzi minyaka le) kodwa ugubungelo lovavanyo olusekuhlaleni lumbalwa ngaphandle kweBloemfontein. <strong>North West</strong> ijongene neengxaki zovavanyo lwabantu abavela ngaphesheya kwemida abangabaseBotswana nabasebenzi bemigodi — isithili saseRustenburg sinamanye amanani aphezulu kakhulu amadoda ane-HIV ngenxa yokufuduka kwabasebenzi bemigodi. <strong>Northern Cape</strong> inelona nani lisezantsi lovavanyo ngenxa yobuncinci babantu, kodwa ugubungelo lovavanyo lwasemaziko lwanele — umngeni kukufikelela kubasebenzi basefama nakwiindawo ezikude eKaroo.',
